			"notes": "### CHANGES\n- Fixed several missing localization issues with newly added items and blocks.\n- Added two new biomes.\n  - Chemical Plant (Kitajima)\n  - Stardust Valley (Miyashita)\n- Added the new Elemental Spirit enemy in 4 variants (Pyro, Cryo, Hydro, Electro)\n- Added drops for the Elemental Golems and Elemental Spirits.\n- Fixed an issue with the ElementalAuraApplicationGoal present in the Elemental Golems and Elemental Spirits that allowed for unusual elemental reactions that could result in server crashes.\n- Added map colors for the wood varieties and Labyrinth stone variants.\n- Removed multiple unused sound files.\n- Updated textures for multiple blocks.\n- Added the Hanasato craftable set (Storybook set).\n- Made Stardust placeable.\n- Added the crafting recipe for Starbits.\n- Fixed the tags for the weapons to be categorized correctly.\n- <img width=\"218\" height=\"215\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93bca063-176f-4bdb-82b9-23cbf1550c53\" />"
