			"notes": "### CHANGES\n- Removed previous attempts at adding elemental combat.\n- Made [Seven Elements](https://github.com/xrickastley/SevenElements/) a required dependency.\n- Added 3 new enemy types.\n  - Dendro Golem, Anemo Golem, Geo Golem\n- Reintroduced catalysts as weapons.\n- Removed the requirement for Trinkets.\n- Added the Ashwood wood variant.\n- Added spawn eggs for the Golems and the ACC grunts.\n- *the Raiden Shogun's eyes start to glow* What?! How dare you defy me! I am the Raiden Shogun! You will either submit to my will, or suffer the wrath of the Musou No Hitotachi! I will count to the number of five, and if you do not stop fighting, you will be cut down with no remorse...\n- <img width=\"1067\" height=\"428\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4691a12f-ba92-4706-9712-db0964c528c1\" />"
